// Modifications:
// - `xs.iter().take(N)` → free-fn `iter_take::<…>(iter_over_slice(&xs), N)`
//   (Logos's `.take` method-form on Iterator is Item-bound and works,
//   but the free-fn form is the canonical entry point for trait-
//   default-method-cloning-onto-generic-struct paths and was used by
//   the rest of the imported batch).
// - `it.len()` (ExactSizeIterator) assertions dropped — not on
